ent-WeaponHeavyLaserBorg = Borg heavy laser cannon
    .desc = Borg Heavy Laser Gun is a high-output directed-energy system built for sustained combat operations. Its capacitors deliver concentrated thermal pulses capable of breaching reinforced materials, while the internal cooling assembly allows continuous firing without performance decay. The weapon integrates directly with borg power systems, removing the need for traditional ammunition and ensuring uninterrupted operational efficiency.
ent-WeaponRifleLecterB = Lecter-B
    .desc = Designed for integration into borg combat units, the Lecter-B is a gas-operated rifle refit from its organic-use counterpart. Operating in semi or full automatic modes, it maintains consistent accuracy, stable recoil behavior, and high stopping power under automated firing routines. Its reinforced internals and simplified maintenance pathways allow continuous operation in environments that would quickly degrade standard rifles.
